  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Drinking Water Supply Project for Kara Region</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the project is to improve the living conditions of the populations of the city of Kara by providing improved and sustainable access to basic drinking water services. The specific objectives of the project are to (i) Increase the drinking water coverage rate in the city of kara from 50% to 75% (ii) increase by 50% the daily volume of water produced (iii) provided with access to safe water supply to 6200 households</narrative>
  </description>
